  speakerName: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0fcb4f4247841f844a4ed3948dae66cf, type: 2}
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  portugueseText: "Eles ficam presos nessa vis\xE3o por horas, e quando finalmente
    se libertam, ficam desolados com o que viram. O primeiro a acordar \xE9 Marco,
    que tenta despertar seu irm\xE3o mais novo da vis\xE3o."
  englishText: They remain trapped in this vision for hours, and when they finally
    break free, they are devastated by what they have seen. The first to wake up
    is Marco, who tries to rouse his younger brother from the vision.
